BOSS Colossus Respawn
    Events
        Time - BossColossusRT expires
    Conditions
    Actions
        Set VariableSet BossVarPoint = (Center of ColossusSpot <gen>)
        Unit - Create 1 Colossus (Level 15) for Neutral Passive at BossVarPoint facing Default building facing degrees
        Special Effect - Create a special effect attached to the overhead of (Last created unit) using Abilities\Spells\Human\Polymorph\PolyMorphDoneGround.mdl
        Set VariableSet BossColossus = (Last created unit)
        Animation - Play BossColossus's sleep animation
        Unit - Pause BossColossus
        Trigger - Turn on Emberpeak Dragonfire Flame Strike Colossus <gen>
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossVarPoint)
